# The case main's move, read against the commit before it. Its files leave the test scope for the library's
# checks: the analysis's rule set and the root's .clang-tidy, in place of the test scope's (ruleset, options' rule
# set, tidy, tidy_from, and the same of the two headers' units); test_code lost and k15 gained. They leave the
# log module, in the services layer, for the case_main module, in the devkit layer; library and core follow the
# layer. The exemptions' test_code target line is gone. The move's own map and expected file are new.
